    "description": "<p>HERITAGE</p>\n<p>Radiance runs faintly through your blood, emerging as light when anger, courage or compassion stirs it.<br>You gain the Good aligned trait and Nightvision.<br>Furthermore, you may cast Guiding Bolt as a Divinity innate spell with the Focus trait.<br>Dawn-Blooded occupies a different niche from Lightwoven and Seraphel: Lightwoven is supportive, Seraphel protective and Dawn-Blooded more overtly radiant.</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Living character</p>\n<p>Works automatically: the Good aligned trait joins your traits, Nightvision is granted, and Guiding Bolt is an innate Divinity spell with the Focus trait on your spell list.</p>",
